      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Risk Disclaimer: Trading CFDs and leveraged financial products involves significant risk and may not be suitable for every individual. Leverage can magnify both profits and losses. You may lose some or all of your invested capital. Understand the product, review the applicable terms and seek independent financial advice where appropriate before trading.</span>",
